{"term": {"label": "道", "occurrences": 12, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "孔子", "id": "孔子"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "陳", "id": "陳"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9878743481543455, "source": "君子", "target": "陳"}, {"weight": 1.7647307968401356, "source": "君子", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.7647307968401356, "source": "君子", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 1.1769441319380167, "source": "君子", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.4282585602189228, "source": "君子", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.2947271675944, "source": "聞", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 1.7647307968401356, "source": "聞", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.1769441319380167, "source": "聞", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.2755564206061263, "source": "聞", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.1769441319380167, "source": "聞", "target": "孔子"}, {"weight": 0.8404718953168039, "source": "知", "target": "聖"}, {"weight": 0.5891574670358977, "source": "知", "target": "孔子"}, {"weight": 1.4000876832522264, "source": "去", "target": "孔子"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "去", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.9878743481543455, "source": "去", "target": "父"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "去", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.5178707189086098, "source": "去", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 1.6514021115331325, "source": "去", "target": "聖"}, {"weight": 1.5336190758767492, "source": "欲", 